---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Yarri Bryn.">
  <div class="about-head">
    <img src="/profile.jpg" alt="Yarri Bryn" width="104" height="104" />
    <div>
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0">Minnesota · <a href={SITE.links.github}>GitHub</a> · <a href={SITE.links.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    I'm a Staff Innovation Engineer at CLA, where I prototype and prove out new solutions, then hand them off
    to the teams that run them. Before that I worked on ML platforms and MLOps: Databricks, Unity Catalog,
    MLflow, Asset Bundles, CI/CD and Terraform on Azure.
  </p>
  <p>
    I came to tech sideways, from local government (and before that, a few years playing golf professionally).
    That path left me with a bias for practical tools that make other people's work easier.
  </p>
  <p>
    These days I'm most interested in AI agents that run reliably without supervision, durable execution,
    developer experience, and learning Rust.
  </p>

  <p>Outside work: golf, time outdoors, and an ever-growing list of projects around the house.</p>
  <p class="muted">The career version is on the <a href="/resume/">Resume</a> page.</p>
</Base>
